                "asset": {
                  "content": "# Billing disputes\n\n`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` owns the current billing classification. A message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.\n\nThe fallback is an implementation detail, not evidence that every non-refund message is an invoice question. The `support` agent applies this classification only to refund and invoice questions. A `refund-review` classification requires human review and is not a promise that a refund will be approved. For an `invoice-question`, support answers only from available project evidence and states when human review is needed.\n",
